  "decision_date": "09/03/2001",
  "description": "Demolition of existing bungalow and car repair buildings. Erection of two storey 3 bedroom house and 5 No one bedroom flats incorporating access, parking, landscaping and refuse storage",
  "site_name": "6",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
